    <p class="text-base sm:text-lg text-body leading-relaxed max-w-3xl">
        Sister sizes are bra size combinations that maintain identical volumetric breast cup capacity while adjusting the underbust band's tightness. Select your current size below to generate your exact tighter-band and looser-band sister sizes, and finally achieve the comfort and support you deserve.
      </p>
